WEBVTT

00:02:57.548 --> 00:03:00.426
that I hadn't seen before, like these.

00:03:01.052 --> 00:03:02.595
And what started with jellyfish,

00:03:02.595 --> 00:03:06.182
very quickly escalated
to other sea creatures

00:03:06.182 --> 00:03:10.436
like sea anemone, coral and fish.

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:16.776
And then from there came amphibians,
birds and insects.

00:03:17.235 --> 00:03:20.154
And this became a series
called “Neural Zoo”.

00:03:22.114 --> 00:03:25.743
But when you look closely,
what do you see?

00:03:25.785 --> 00:03:29.747
There's no single creature
in these images.